      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Recurrent abdominal pain is a distressing childhood phenomenon. It is a benign pain syndrome, with no definitive cause, affecting more than 10% of all school-aged children. It is important for gastrointestinal nurses to recognize the symptoms of recurrent abdominal pain and provide individualized management for the child and family."},
